1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:03,460
Captain Frere says
that the scenery is delightful.

2
00:00:04,055 --> 00:00:08,375
Abandoned, indeed, by God and man almost.

3
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:12,130
In the valley of the shadow
of death He is with us.

4
00:00:12,485 --> 00:00:15,155
You have not been long
in the colony, mister Meekin.

5
00:00:15,645 --> 00:00:17,815
If you please, said Meekin gravely.

6
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:20,710
Pray help yourself to wine.

7
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:25,020
Have you many visitors,
Captain Burgess? Very few.
